{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sd5b3348c89607a08","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-d8dfb2e432710cc0c56c","text":"听好了喀，这是一段被掩盖起来的故事，只有最智慧的人才能知晓答案——「浪漫」与「理性」两位泰坦是何关系？","speaker":"匿史虫"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-1b483b17c437e514dca2","text":"造物与创造者。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-a16587ee738b3b41848d","text":"学生与老师。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-cc4cf3c295405b617d32","text":"友人兼恋人。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-30bb3d2ef64d5bdab06b","text":"以上都是。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-e541e8261f63a7107b05","text":"回答正确！你发现了卵石下的青苔——不要把它和别人分享。","speaker":"匿史虫"}]}
